          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakahimulambu laŋa Yehova himulambu wakushita, wevumba dadiwahi; iyoŋa daŋombi weyala wumu, nichizamba chamukoku wumu, anyana kanyikoku ayizamba amwaka wumu atanu nayedi; akekalaŋa enu akadi ninaha hataminawu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
