        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakalambuli himulambu wakushita, himulambu wakwila nakesi, wakumununkishila Yehova ivumba dadiwahi; aŋombi amayala amayoŋa ikumi nasatu, yizamba yanyikoku yiyedi, anyana kanyikoku ayizamba amwaka wumu ikumi nawana; akekalaŋa akadi ninaha hataminawu; ",
